DTSTAMP:20261016T220539Z
DTSTART:20261121T143000Z
DTEND:20261121T150000Z
SUMMARY:VRChat International Science Community
DESCRIPTION:集会: VRChat International Science Community 開催日時: 20
 26年11月21日 23:30 開催時間: 30分 Let's talk about science! We hold
  LTs (Lightning Talks) hosted by group members about once every two weeks. 
 Feel free to join usǃ There's absolutely no need to worry about not knowin
 g anyone of the existing members․ We wish you a fruitful exchange․ Expe
